    "What do order statuses mean?": "What do အော်ဒါ statuses mean?",
    "Payment Pending means payment is not confirmed. Manual Review means the order needs admin verification. Paid, Processing, Completed, Failed, Refund Requested, Refunded, Rejected, Cancelled, and Expired describe the current order or refund stage.": "ငွေပေးချေမှု စောင့်ဆိုင်းနေသည် means ငွေပေးချေမှု is not confirmed. Manual Review means the အော်ဒါ needs admin verification. Paid, လုပ်ဆောင်နေသည်, ပြီးစီးပြီး, မအောင်မြင်ပါ, Refund Requested, Refunded, ငြင်းပယ်ပြီး, မလုပ်တော့ပါled, and Expired describe the current အော်ဒါ or refund stage.",
    "Why is my order still Payment Pending?": "Why is my အော်ဒါ still ငွေပေးချေမှု စောင့်ဆိုင်းနေသည်?",
    "Payment Pending means AZIEL has not confirmed the payment yet. A submitted payment, receipt, or upload is not the same as confirmed payment.": "ငွေပေးချေမှု စောင့်ဆိုင်းနေသည် means AZIEL has not confirmed the ငွေပေးချေမှု yet. A submitted ငွေပေးချေမှု, receipt, or upload is not the same as confirmed ငွေပေးချေမှု.",
    "What does Manual Review mean?": "What does Manual Review mean?",
    "Manual Review means AZIEL needs to verify payment, order details, or risk signals before continuing. Support may ask for order context but never passwords, OTPs, or payment PINs.": "Manual Review means AZIEL needs to verify ငွေပေးချေမှု, အော်ဒါ details, or risk signals before continuing. အကူအညီ may ask for အော်ဒါ context but never စကားဝှက်s, OTPs, or ငွေပေးချေမှု PINs.",
    "What happens after payment is confirmed?": "What happens after ငွေပေးချေမှု is confirmed?",
    "The order can move to Paid and then Processing. Completion depends on product delivery and third-party fulfillment availability.": "The အော်ဒါ can move to Paid and then လုပ်ဆောင်နေသည်. Completion depends on product delivery and third-party fulfillment availability.",
    "What should I do if my top-up is not received?": "What should I do if my top-up is not received?",
