    "with your Order ID and game identifiers.": "with your အော်ဒါ ID and game identifiers.",
    "Refunds can be requested for eligible failed or cancelled orders and are reviewed against platform records. See the": "Refunds can be requested for eligible failed or cancelled အော်ဒါများ and are reviewed against platform records. See the",
    "Where will an approved refund be credited?": "Where will an approved refund be credited?",
    "Approved and completed refunds are credited to your AZIEL Wallet according to the current refund flow.": "အတည်ပြုပြီး and completed refunds are credited to your AZIEL ပိုက်ဆံအိတ် according to the current refund flow.",
    "What happens if I enter the wrong User ID or Server ID?": "What happens if I enter the wrong User ID or Server ID?",
    "Orders rely on the identifiers you provide. Wrong identifiers may cause delivery to the wrong account and may be non-refundable after successful delivery.": "အော်ဒါများ rely on the identifiers you provide. Wrong identifiers may cause delivery to the wrong အကောင့် and may be non-refundable after successful delivery.",
    "Can a completed digital order be cancelled?": "Can a completed digital အော်ဒါ be cancelled?",
    "Completed digital orders are usually not reversible because fulfillment may already be delivered through a third-party product system.": "ပြီးစီးပြီး digital အော်ဒါများ are usually not reversible because fulfillment may already be delivered through a third-party product system.",
