    "Available Payment Options": "Available ငွေပေးချေမှု Options",
    "Payment options are shown during checkout and may vary by region, product, currency, account context, provider status, and current platform configuration. Static policy pages describe the model; checkout is the source of current availability.": "ငွေပေးချေမှု options are shown during checkout and may vary by region, product, currency, အကောင့် context, provider status, and current platform configuration. Static policy pages describe the model; checkout is the source of current availability.",
    "Payment Submitted vs Confirmed": "ငွေပေးချေမှု တင်သွင်းမည်ted vs Confirmed",
    "A submitted payment, opened payment request, uploaded evidence, or sent transfer is not the same as confirmed payment. Orders begin processing only after AZIEL receives automatic confirmation or completes manual verification.": "A submitted ငွေပေးချေမှု, opened ငွေပေးချေမှု request, uploaded evidence, or sent transfer is not the same as confirmed ငွေပေးချေမှု. အော်ဒါများ begin processing only after AZIEL receives automatic confirmation or completes manual verification.",
    "Automatic and Manual Confirmation": "Automatic and Manual Confirmation",
    "Some payment methods may be confirmed automatically through the configured provider flow.": "Some ငွေပေးချေမှု methods may be confirmed automatically through the configured provider flow.",
