    "Manual Review may be required when evidence is unclear, the amount differs, duplicate payments exist, or risk controls apply.": "Manual Review may be လိုအပ်သည် when evidence is unclear, the amount differs, duplicate ငွေပေးချေမှုs exist, or risk controls apply.",
    "Regional Providers and Test Mode": "Regional Providers and Test Mode",
    "Regional payment names can appear only when configured for the current product and region. PromptPay provider flows must not be treated as production-live unless the active environment and provider configuration support live processing.": "Regional ငွေပေးချေမှု names can appear only when configured for the current product and region. PromptPay provider flows must not be treated as production-live unless the active environment and provider configuration အကူအညီ live processing.",
    "Incorrect Amounts, Duplicate Payments, and Expired Requests": "Incorrect ပမာဏs, Duplicate ငွေပေးချေမှုs, and Expired Requests",
    "Incorrect transfer amounts, duplicate payments, expired payment sessions, provider timeouts, or mismatched evidence may delay confirmation and require support review. Keep your payment evidence until the order or wallet top-up is resolved.": "Incorrect transfer amounts, duplicate ငွေပေးချေမှုs, expired ငွေပေးချေမှု sessions, provider timeouts, or mismatched evidence may delay confirmation and require အကူအညီ review. Keep your ငွေပေးချေမှု evidence until the အော်ဒါ or ပိုက်ဆံအိတ် top-up is resolved.",
    "Wallet Balance and Product Eligibility": "ပိုက်ဆံအိတ် Balance and Product Eligibility",
    "Payment Safety": "ငွေပေးချေမှု Safety",
