    "Some orders or payments may require Manual Review. AZIEL may decline, cancel, fail, or hold an order when payment cannot be verified, details are inaccurate, risk controls apply, or product fulfillment is unavailable.": "Some အော်ဒါများ or ငွေပေးချေမှုs may require Manual Review. AZIEL may decline, cancel, fail, or hold an အော်ဒါ when ငွေပေးချေမှု cannot be verified, details are inaccurate, risk controls apply, or product fulfillment is unavailable.",
