    "AZIEL 1Tap TopUp": "AZIEL 1Tap TopUp",
    "1. Please make sure your Game ID / Server ID is correct before payment.": "1. Please make sure your ဂိမ်း ID / Server ID is correct before ငွေပေးချေမှု.",
