    "EA Sports FC": "EA Sports FC",
    "AZIEL Wallet may be available for eligible purchases or refund credits. Wallet balance updates only after the relevant top-up, refund, or adjustment is confirmed in platform records.": "AZIEL ပိုက်ဆံအိတ် may be available for eligible purchases or refund credits. ပိုက်ဆံအိတ် balance updates only after the relevant top-up, refund, or adjustment is confirmed in platform records.",
    "AZIEL will never ask for your password, OTP, recovery code, banking password, payment PIN, or private banking login. Public Telegram and Discord channels are not appropriate places to submit private payment evidence.": "AZIEL will never ask for your password, OTP, recovery code, banking password, ငွေပေးချေမှု PIN, or private banking login. Public Telegram and Discord channels are not appropriate places to submit private ငွေပေးချေမှု evidence.",
    "AZIEL 1Tap Shop uses customer information to operate accounts, orders, wallet services, payment verification, notifications, fraud prevention, and support. This policy explains the categories of information we handle and the choices available to you.": "AZIEL 1Tap Shop uses customer information to operate accounts, အော်ဒါs, ပိုက်ဆံအိတ် services, ငွေပေးချေမှု verification, notifications, fraud prevention, and အကူအညီ. This policy explains the categories of information we handle and the choices available to you.",
    "AZIEL may use third-party categories such as payment providers, email delivery services, hosting/database infrastructure, media storage, analytics or logging tools, product or fulfillment providers, and communication/community platforms. These services are used only where needed for platform operation, support, security, or delivery.": "AZIEL may use third-party categories such as ငွေပေးချေမှု providers, email delivery services, hosting/database infrastructure, media storage, analytics or logging tools, product or fulfillment providers, and communication/community platforms. These services are used only where needed for platform operation, အကူအညီ, security, or delivery.",
    "AZIEL uses reasonable technical and administrative safeguards for account, payment, wallet, and order records. No online system can guarantee absolute security. AZIEL will never ask for your password, OTP, recovery code, banking password, or payment PIN.": "AZIEL uses reasonable technical and administrative safeguards for account, ငွေပေးချေမှု, ပိုက်ဆံအိတ်, and အော်ဒါ records. No online system can guarantee absolute security. AZIEL will never ask for your password, OTP, recovery code, banking password, or ငွေပေးချေမှု PIN.",
    "AZIEL provides digital products that may be fulfilled through third-party systems. Refund eligibility depends on order, payment, fulfillment, wallet, and support records.": "AZIEL provides digital products that may be fulfilled through third-party systems. Refund eligibility depends on အော်ဒါ, ငွေပေးချေမှု, fulfillment, ပိုက်ဆံအိတ်, and အကူအညီ records.",
    "AZIEL or a fulfillment dependency confirmed that the product could not be delivered.": "AZIEL or a fulfillment dependency confirmed that the product could not be delivered.",
    "AZIEL reviews payment confirmation, fulfillment state, support records, wallet ledger, and abuse signals.": "AZIEL reviews ငွေပေးချေမှု confirmation, fulfillment state, အကူအညီ records, ပိုက်ဆံအိတ် ledger, and abuse signals.",
    "AZIEL Support can help with order status, payment confirmation, wallet questions, refund requests, account access, security concerns, product availability questions, and general platform issues.": "AZIEL အကူအညီ can help with အော်ဒါ status, ငွေပေးချေမှု confirmation, ပိုက်ဆံအိတ် questions, refund requests, account access, security concerns, product availability questions, and general platform issues.",
    "AZIEL reviews support requests as operational capacity allows. Response times can vary by ticket volume, payment provider checks, third-party fulfillment dependencies, and investigation complexity. Response and resolution timing are not fixed.": "AZIEL reviews အကူအညီ requests as operational capacity allows. Response times can vary by ticket volume, ငွေပေးချေမှု provider checks, third-party fulfillment dependencies, and investigation complexity. Response and resolution timing are not fixed.",
    "AZIEL may restrict access when fraud, abuse, unauthorized access, or security risk is suspected.": "AZIEL may restrict access when fraud, abuse, unauthorized access, or security risk is suspected.",
    "AZIEL may limit, suspend, or delay access for maintenance, security, abuse prevention, provider outages, fulfillment dependency issues, or operational risk. AZIEL does not control every third-party payment, email, hosting, product, or fulfillment system.": "AZIEL may limit, suspend, or delay access for maintenance, security, abuse prevention, provider outages, fulfillment dependency issues, or operational risk. AZIEL does not control every third-party ငွေပေးချေမှု, email, hosting, product, or fulfillment system.",
    "AZIEL names, interface, content, and platform materials belong to their respective owners. Product names and game names may belong to third parties. AZIEL does not claim publisher affiliation, ongoing availability, fixed delivery time, or absolute security.": "AZIEL names, interface, content, and platform materials belong to their respective owners. Product names and ဂိမ်း names may belong to third parties. AZIEL does not claim publisher affiliation, ongoing availability, fixed delivery time, or absolute security.",
    "AZIEL may update these terms when the platform or policies change. For questions about these terms, contact the Support Center.": "AZIEL may update these terms when the platform or policies change. For questions about these terms, contact the အကူအညီ Center.",
    "AZIEL 1Tap Shop respects your privacy and protects your data.": "AZIEL 1Tap Shop respects your privacy and protects your data.",
    "1. We only collect necessary information such as username, order data, and contact details.": "1. We only collect necessary information such as username, အော်ဒါ data, and contact details.",
    "2. Payment screenshots or references are used only for order verification.": "2. ငွေပေးချေမှု screenshots or references are used only for အော်ဒါ verification.",
    "3. Your personal data will not be sold or shared with unauthorized parties.": "3. Your personal data will not be sold or shared with unauthorized parties.",
    "4. We use secure systems to help protect your account information.": "4. We use လုံခြုံသော systems to help protect your account information.",
    "5. By using this website, you agree to this privacy policy.": "5. By using this website, you agree to this privacy policy.",
